import{_ as a,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 779 | Transcended Ones and Myriad Races | The Transcended One's Myriad-Rank Feedback Obligation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 779 | Transcended Ones and Myriad Races | The Transcended One's Myriad-Rank Feedback Obligation","no":779,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Myriad Races","Feedback Obligation","Myriad-Origin Two-Way Cycle","Joint Production Contract"],"related":["25-Symbiotic Feedback-Cycle Mechanism","22-Resource-Allocation Joint-Production-Contract Mechanism","777-Transcended Ones and Myriad Races Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0779_模块4-万族-超脱者的反哺义务.md","filePath":"en/0779_模块4-万族-超脱者的反哺义务.md"}`),t={name:"en/0779_模块4-万族-超脱者的反哺义务.md"};function r(s,e,l,d,c,h){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-779-transcended-ones-and-myriad-races-the-transcended-one-s-myriad-rank-feedback-obligation" tabindex="-1">Entry 779 | Transcended Ones and Myriad Races | The Transcended One&#39;s Myriad-Rank Feedback Obligation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-779-transcended-ones-and-myriad-races-the-transcended-one-s-myriad-rank-feedback-obligation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 779 | Transcended Ones and Myriad Races | The Transcended One&#39;s Myriad-Rank Feedback Obligation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 25, 22, 777</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-come-from-myriad-ranks-go-back-to-myriad-ranks" tabindex="-1">Introduction: come from Myriad Ranks, go back to Myriad Ranks <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-come-from-myriad-ranks-go-back-to-myriad-ranks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: come from Myriad Ranks, go back to Myriad Ranks&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A transcended one&#39;s power is not conjured out of thin air by himself. Every wisp of spiritual energy he absorbed on his cultivation road, every thread of law, every moment of sudden enlightenment — behind it all is the whole Myriad-Origin two-way cycle transfusing him. Heng Yuan Zhou therefore has an iron rule: <strong>power that came from Myriad Ranks must return to Myriad Ranks.</strong> This is the transcended one&#39;s Myriad-Rank feedback obligation. This entry breaks this obligation into a quantifiable, auditable, accountable post description.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all line up: the anti-predation axiom is the feedback obligation&#39;s flip side — only-in-no-out is predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races is the feedback obligation&#39;s jurisprudential source; the collective ascension axiom is the feedback obligation&#39;s direction; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the feedback process not disturb Myriad Ranks&#39; causality; the law-first axiom requires the feedback obligation be quantifiable and executable at the law layer.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-feedback-obligation-s-four-hard-indicators" tabindex="-1">I. Feedback Obligation&#39;s Four Hard Indicators <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-feedback-obligation-s-four-hard-indicators" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Feedback Obligation&#39;s Four Hard Indicators&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After entering the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, the transcended one&#39;s feedback obligation is real-time quantified by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision on four hard indicators:</p><ol><li><strong>Knowledge feedback rate</strong>: new cultivation manuals, new law-weavings, and new civilizational-engineering proposals produced during his cultivation must be opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao. Feedback rate = opened knowledge / total knowledge output; red line is 95%;</li><li><strong>Computable-power feedback amount</strong>: a fixed proportion (baseline 50%) of his personal computable power must be invested in public civilizational engineering — law calibration, star-sector maintenance, new-recruit training, etc. Computable-power feedback amount is auto-accounted by Alaya Network;</li><li><strong>Resource feedback amount</strong>: in his joint-production-contract resource pool, a proportion (baseline 20%) must be fed back to Myriad Ranks&#39; weak-coverage races (plant spirits, planet consciousnesses, low-order alien races) development funds;</li><li><strong>Time feedback amount</strong>: each year he must spend a fixed duration (baseline 30%) on frontline service — stationed in Myriad-Rank clans, teaching, mediating; he cannot only issue orders from high-level meeting rooms.</li></ol><p>Any one of the four indicators below red line for two consecutive cycles triggers a post interview; below red line for four consecutive cycles downgrades civilizational weight.</p><h2 id="ii-why-feedback-is-obligation-not-gift" tabindex="-1">II. Why Feedback Is Obligation, Not Gift <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-feedback-is-obligation-not-gift" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why Feedback Is Obligation, Not Gift&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world calls the strong helping the weak &quot;gift&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou calls it &quot;obligation.&quot; One character&#39;s difference, worlds apart:</p><ul><li><strong>Gift is decided by the giver</strong>: how much the strong one gives, what he gives, to whom he gives, all depends on his mood;</li><li><strong>Obligation is owed to the receiver</strong>: Myriad Ranks have a legitimate claim on the transcended one&#39;s feedback; it is not &quot;begging him to give,&quot; but &quot;he must give.&quot;</li></ul><p>This difference is already mathematized in entry 706&#39;s civilizational-weight formula: the origin-legality subitem requires the transcended one&#39;s power all come from the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle. Since power&#39;s origin is Myriad Ranks&#39;, feedback is not &quot;extra good deed,&quot; but &quot;paying back the debt.&quot; A transcended one who does not pay back directly loses points on origin legality.</p><h2 id="iii-feedback-is-not-one-way-alms" tabindex="-1">III. Feedback Is Not One-Way Alms <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-feedback-is-not-one-way-alms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Feedback Is Not One-Way Alms&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The feedback obligation is most easily misunderstood as &quot;the strong give alms to the weak.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou must clarify: <strong>feedback is not alms, but cycle.</strong></p><p>The Myriad-Origin two-way cycle&#39;s way of working is:</p><ol><li>Every Myriad-Rank being produces origin increment at his own post;</li><li>Increment converges through Alaya Network to the anchor network;</li><li>The anchor network distributes increment to cultivators in need — including transcended ones;</li><li>The transcended one uses this increment to cultivate, producing higher-tier knowledge and computable power;</li><li>The transcended one feeds knowledge and computable power back into the network;</li><li>The network again distributes this feedback to every Myriad-Rank being.</li></ol><p>In this cycle, the transcended one is not &quot;giving Myriad Ranks grace,&quot; but &quot;a high-power node on the cycle chain.&quot; He feeds back because his position is on the cycle chain — if he does not feed back, the cycle breaks, and his own origin also cuts off.</p><h2 id="iv-feedback-obligation-and-the-justified-rascal" tabindex="-1">IV. Feedback Obligation and the Justified Rascal <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-feedback-obligation-and-the-justified-rascal" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Feedback Obligation and the Justified Rascal&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The feedback obligation has a special function: it is the institutional tool against &quot;justified rascals.&quot;</p><p>&quot;Justified rascal&quot; refers to strong ones who, under the banner of &quot;for your own good,&quot; actually pull resources toward themselves. The feedback obligation&#39;s four hard indicators turn &quot;for your own good&quot; from slogan into numbers — you say you&#39;re good for Myriad Ranks; then what&#39;s the knowledge feedback rate? Computable-power feedback amount? Resource feedback amount? Time feedback amount? Numbers insufficient, no matter how many fine words, useless.</p><p>This is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s way against &quot;justified rascals&quot;: <strong>don&#39;t listen to what you say; look at what the Alaya Network recorded.</strong></p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the feedback obligation pulls the transcended one&#39;s computable power, knowledge, resources, and time from the private domain back into the public cycle, eliminating only-in-no-out energy waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the feedback obligation&#39;s flip side is predation — only-in-no-out is advanced predation; four hard indicators directly seal this road</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo took everything from the Myriad-Origin cycle, yet locked later-comers in the fierce realm; Heng Yuan Zhou uses four feedback indicators to force him to pay back</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: resource feedback amount explicitly requires covering Myriad Ranks&#39; weak-coverage races, ensuring feedback does not only flow around strong ones</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: knowledge feedback rate requires over 95% of hyper-multiverse-grade knowledge to be opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao, eliminating private hoarding</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s feedback obligation is not a high moral requirement, but a law-layer hard indicator. Four numbers sit on the Alaya Network; more is contribution, less is violation. Power that came from Myriad Ranks must return to Myriad Ranks — this is not sentiment, this is a ledger. The numbers on the ledger are more honest than any manifesto.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic Feedback-Cycle Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/22-资源分配联产承包机制.html">Entry 22 · Resource-Allocation Joint-Production-Contract Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/777_模块4-超脱者与万族-总论.html">Entry 777 · Transcended Ones and Myriad Ranks Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/706-超脱者的文明权重.html">Entry 706 · Transcended One&#39;s Civilizational Weight</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const b=a(t,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,b as default};
